mate Change AI Virtual Summer School</a>&nbsp;</strong>in 2026!&nbsp;This y=
ear=E2=80=99s program will take place from <strong>July 19 - August 22, 202=
6, </strong>and will be hosted<strong> fully online.</strong><br>
<br>
The CCAI Virtual Summer School provides participants with the opportunity t=
